label 57
text The next batter keeps perfect track of the ball, but fortunately, he hits a line drive to third. Misae-san catches it right in front of her.
text The ninth batter in their order is up. He smacks the first pitch.
text It bounces straight back toward the pitcher's mound... and Furukawa.
text She jumps in the air and grabs the ball high in the sky.
text @[Tomoya]
text Furukawa!
text I yell at her, and she arcs the ball to me.
text *Bap*
text A split second before the hitter passes me, the ball makes its way into my glove.
